en\":\"三、為什麼亞洲讀者特別容易神化他\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-4\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-4\",\"children\":\"四、和李佛摩對讀\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-5\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-5\",\"children\":\"五、最小動作\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-6\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-6\",\"children\":\"常見問題 FAQ\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-7\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-7\",\"children\":\"總結\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-8\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-8\",\"children\":\"延伸閱讀\"}]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_body__6B7Mb\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_intro__ATV5c\",\"children\":\"是川銀藏在日文與中文世界都被寫成傳奇投機者。傳播最愛他的點位與戰役。公開傳記較有用的部分，其實比較土：自己做功課、肯等、以及知道某段該收。點位不能搬到台股；土的三件事可以拿來檢查自己是不是只在收藏戰役。\"}],[],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tldr__Br5BY\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"b\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tldrTitle__K5PBN\",\"children\":\"本文重點\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tldrList__VSc2_\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"傳奇點位不能跨市場搬，功課習慣可以檢查\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"等待常被故事刪掉，卻是過程的大部分\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"不會收手的傳奇，最後只剩傳奇\"}]]}]]}],[[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-1\",{\"id\":\"sec-1\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"一、先把戰役放下\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"戰役好講，因為有對手、有高潮。傳記裡若只剩高潮，你會以為投機是一場場決戰。比較接近日常的是：大部分時間在讀、在等、在什麼都不做。什麼都不做，對習慣看盤的人最難。\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"高潮是剪輯\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"日常是等待\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"等待最難學\"}]]}]]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-2\",{\"id\":\"sec-2\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"二、三個教訓\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"第一，資訊要自己整理，不要只靠傳播的一句話。第二，看法可以很早，尺寸要能活過「看起來像錯」的那段。第三，收手是技術，不是年老之後的情緒。第三個在李佛摩故事裡以反面出現：不收手。\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"傳播喜歡\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"教訓\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"台股版檢查\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"神準點位\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"點位不能搬\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"不要背數字\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"一戰定江山\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"多數時間在等\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"你有沒有空倉規則\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"永遠進攻\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"收手是技術\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"賺的部位怎麼結束\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"獨門消息\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"自己整理公開資訊\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"依據能不能重做\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-3\",{\"id\":\"sec-3\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"三、為什麼亞洲讀者特別容易神化他\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"地理與語言近，故事傳得勤。神化會讓你以為有一種東方秘訣。公開材料能核對的，仍是功課、等待與收手，和金融怪傑裡那些無聊句子同一家族。\"}],[\"$\",\"ol\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_listNum__86N5S\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"把秘訣假設刪掉\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"只留能檢查的習慣\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"點位當娛樂\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"figure\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_fig__uoT7r\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_figFrame__jJ7E4\",\"children\":\"!背點位!天天決戰!獨門消息\"}],[\"$\",\"figcaption\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_figCap__LnUbb\",\"children\":\"神化\"}]]}]]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-4\",{\"id\":\"sec-4\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"四、和李佛摩對讀\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"兩個都被寫成能讀大行情的人，也都留下「人如何被自己的傳奇傷害」的材料。對讀不是比誰比較神，是看收手與認賠有沒有被故事刪掉。刪掉的，通常是你最該留的。\"}],\"$L18\"]]}],\"$L19\",\"$L1a\",\"$L1b\",\"$L1c\"],\"$L1d\"]}]]}]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"神化會刪收手\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"對讀看被刪的\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"被刪的當作業\"}]]}]\n19:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-5\",{\"id\":\"sec-5\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"五、最小動作\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"這週若你沒有空倉的日子，先問是不是沒有「什麼都不做」的規則。傳奇人物的日常，往往包含大量不做。\"}]]]}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-6\",{\"id\":\"sec-6\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"常見問題 FAQ\"}],[[\"$\",\"div\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faq__cemBp\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"他的方法能用在台股嗎？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"點位與商品不能搬。功課、等待、收手可以檢查。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"為什麼不寫那些有名的戰役？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"戰役會把人帶回點位。本站人物文契約是不寫可被當成訊號的數字。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"和邱永漢差在哪？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"是川常被寫成投機戰役；邱永漢較常被寫成看錢的觀念。都要去神化。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"空倉算不算浪費？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"對必須每天動作的人像浪費。對要活過等待的人，是規則。\"}]]}]]}]]]}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-7\",{\"id\":\"sec-7\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"總結\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"是川銀藏能留的是自己做功課、肯等、會收手，不是傳奇點位。神化會刪掉日常的不做。點位當娛樂，習慣當作業。\"}]]]}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-8\",{\"id\":\"sec-8\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"延伸閱讀\"}],[[\"$\",\"ul\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-李佛摩的教訓\",{\"href\":\"/learn/jesse-livermore-lessons-not-the-legend\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"李佛摩的教訓\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-邱永漢看市場\",{\"href\":\"/learn/qiu-yonghan-money-philosophy\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"邱永漢看市場\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-職業交易員的一天\",{\"href\":\"/learn/what-a-professional-trader-day-actually-looks-like\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"職業交易員的一天\"}]]}]]}]]]}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_related__9qV55\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_relatedTitle__RXfrl\",\"children\":\"相關文章\"}],[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"jesse-livermore-lessons-not-the-legend\",{\"href\":\"/learn/jesse-livermore-lessons-not-the-legend\",\"className\":\"Lear